{"id": "8th-u6-q727", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "textbook-eval-q5-reason-gifts", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டு வினா: சிங்கிக்குப் பலவகைப்பட்ட விலையுயர்ந்த பரிசுப் பொருள்கள் கிடைக்க அடிப்படைக் காரணமாக அமைந்தது எது?"}], "options": {"A": "நடனமாடுதல்", "B": "பாட்டுப் பாடுதல்", "C": "குறி சொல்லுதல்", "D": "மருத்துவம் செய்தல்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு (பக். 116 வினா 5): சிங்கிக்குப் பலவகை பரிசுப் பொருள்கள் கிடைக்கக் காரணம் 'குறி சொல்லுதல்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook Evaluation Question: What was the primary reason Singi was gifted numerous precious ornaments?"}], "options": {"A": "Dancing", "B": "Singing songs", "C": "Fortune-telling / Palmistry (Kuri solludhal)", "D": "Practicing indigenous medicine"}, "explanation": "Textbook Evaluation (Page 116, Q5): The sole reason Singi received lavish gifts was her talent for fortune-telling (Kuri solludhal)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "editi