{"id": "8th-u6-q728", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kavirayar-poetic-crown", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திரிகூடராசப்பக் கவிராயர் இயற்றிய நூல்களுள் 'அவரது கவிதைக் கிரீடம்' என்று தமிழ் உலகத்தால் போற்றப்படும் நூல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "திருக்குற்றாலத் தலபுராணம்", "B": "திருக்குற்றால மாலை", "C": "குழல்வாய்மொழி பிள்ளைத்தமிழ்", "D": "திருக்குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி"}, "explanation": "நூல் வெளி (பக். 115): 'இவரது நூல்களுள் திருக்குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி திரிகூடராசப்பக் கவிராயரின் கவிதைக் கிரீடம் என்று போற்றப்படுகிறது'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which among the literary creations of Thirikooda Rasappa Kavirayar is hailed across the Tamil world as his 'Poetic Crown'?"}], "options": {"A": "Thirukutrala Thala Puranam", "B": "Thirukutrala Maalai", "C": "Kuzhalvaaimozhi Pillaithamil", "D": "Thirukutrala Kuravanji"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 115: 'Among his works, Thirukutrala Kuravanji is revered as the Poetic Crown of Thirikooda Rasappa Kavirayar'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporati