{"id": "8th-u6-q784", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u6-naadu", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mgr-bharat-ratna-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திய அரசு புரட்சித்தலைவர் எம்.ஜி.ஆருக்கு எந்த ஆண்டில் நாட்டின் மிக உயரிய 'பாரத ரத்னா' விருதினை வழங்கிச் சிறப்பித்தது?"}], "options": {"A": "1977", "B": "1984", "C": "1987", "D": "1988"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 119: 'இந்திய அரசு, எம்.ஜி.ஆரின் சமூகச் சேவையைப் பாராட்டி 1988-ஆம் ஆண்டு பாரத ரத்னா (இந்திய மாமணி) விருதினை வழங்கிச் சிறப்பித்தது'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which year did the Government of India confer the nation's highest civilian honor 'Bharat Ratna' on Puratchi Thalaivar M.G.R.?"}], "options": {"A": "1977", "B": "1984", "C": "1987", "D": "1988"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 119: The Government of India bestowed the Bharat Ratna on M.G.R. in 1988."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 119, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "