{"id": "8th-u6-q803", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "characters-kinship-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கதையில் இடம்பெறும் கதாபாத்திரங்களின் உறவுமுறைகளைப் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) குப்புசாமியின் சித்தி - 1. கட்டைத் தொட்டி ஆறுமுகம்\nஆ) குப்புசாமியின் உயிர் நண்பன் - 2. தங்கவேலுவின் மனைவி\nஇ) காஞ்சிபுரத்து விறகுக்கடைக்காரன் - 3. க. வீரப்பன்\nஈ) பக்கத்து வீட்டுக் குடித்தனக்காரர் - 4. தங்கவேலு"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2", "C": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "குப்புசாமியின் சித்தி: தங்கவேலுவின் மனைவி (2), உயிர் நண்பன்: க. வீரப்பன் (3), விறகுக்கடைக்காரன்: ஆறுமுகம் (1), பக்கத்து வீட்டுக் குடித்தனக்காரர்: தங்கவேலு (4). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 3, 1, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the relationship roles of the characters in the narrative:\na) Kuppusamy's maternal aunt - 1. Kattai Thotti Arumugam\nb) Kuppusamy's soul friend - 2. Wife of Thangavelu\nc) Kanchipuram firewood depot worker - 3. K. Veerappan\nd) Adjacent household tenant - 4. Thangavelu"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1"}, "explanation": "Kuppusamy's aunt: Thangavelu's wife (2), Soul friend: Veerappan (3), Firewood worker: Arumugam (1), Tenant neighbor: Thangavelu (4). Sequence: 2, 3, 1, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 124, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "matching", "kinship", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q804", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "prologue-grammar-metrics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"துணையின்றி வாழும் நிலை இரங்கத்தக்கது! ... மனிதத்தின் வேருக்கு நீர். அதில் மனிதம் துளிர்க்கும்.\" - இத்தொடரில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள இலக்கணக் கூறுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. 'துணையின்றி' என்பது 'இன்றி' என்னும் சொல்லோடு அமைந்த குறிப்பு வினையெச்சம் ஆகும்.\n2. 'வேருக்கு' என்பதில் நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபு (கு) வெளிப்பட்டு வந்துள்ளது.\n3. 'துளிர்க்கும்' என்பது செய்யுமென் எச்சம் / எதிர்கால வினைமுற்று அமைப்பில் உள்ளது.\n4. 'மனிதம்' என்பது மனிதப் பண்பினைக் குறிக்கும் பண்புப் பெயர்ச்சொல் ஆகும்."}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "2, 3 மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "1, 2, 4 மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "1, 2, 3, 4 அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "'துணையின்றி' - குறிப்பு வினையெச்சம்; 'வேருக்கு' - கு நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபு; 'துளிர்க்கும்' - எதிர்கால வினைமுற்று; 'மனிதம்' - பண்புப்பெயர். அனைத்து இலக்கணக் கூறுகளும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze the grammatical constituents in the introductory line 'Thunaiyindri vaazhum nilai irangathakkathu...':\n1. 'Thunaiyindri' functions as a non-finite verbal participle formed with 'indri'.\n2. 'Vaerukku' exhibits the overt fourth case marker 'ku'.\n3. 'Thulirkkum' is structured as a future-tense finite verb / participle.\n4. 'Manitham' represents an abstract noun denoting human compassion."}], "options": {"A": "Only 1, 2 are correct", "B": "Only 2, 3 are correct", "C": "Only 1, 2, 4 are correct", "D": "All 1, 2, 3, 4 are correct"}, "explanation": "'Thunaiyindri' is a verbal participle; 'ku' in 'Vaerukku' is 4th case marker; 'Thulirkkum' is future finite verb; 'Manitham' is abstract quality noun. All 4 statements are grammatically correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 122, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "grammar", "case-markers", "parts-of-speech", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q805", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thematic-symbolism-analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்' என்னும் சிறுகதைத் தலைப்பின் ஆழமான குறியீட்டுப் பொருள் (Thematic Significance) யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "உலகமே ஒதுக்கித் தள்ளினாலும் ஆதரவற்ற ஒருவனுக்கு அன்பும் துணையும் தருவதற்கு ஓர் உள்ளம் இருக்கும்; அந்தத் தூய அன்பே பிறரையும் மனிதநேயமிக்கவர்களாக மாற்றும் ஆற்றல் கொண்டது", "B": "அரசு மருத்துவமனையில் சிகிச்சை பெறும்போது எப்போதும் உதவிக்கு ஒரு மருத்துவர் பணியில் இருப்பார் என்பதைக் குறிக்கிறது", "C": "காஞ்சிபுரத்து சைக்கிள் பழுதுபார்க்கும் பட்டறையில் எப்பொழுதும் ஒரு தொழிலாளி பணியில் இருப்பார் என்பதை உணர்த்துகிறது", "D": "சென்னைப் பெருநகரில் வாடகைக்கு வீடு தேடும்போது ஒரு குடித்தனக்காரர் துணையாக இருப்பார் என்பதைக் குறிக்கிறது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 126: துணையே இல்லாத அனாதை என்று புறக்கணிக்கப்படும் எளியவனுக்கும் உயிரைக் கொடுக்கும் ஒரு தூய நட்பும் அன்பும் இருக்கும்; அந்த அன்பின் வெளிப்பாடே பிறரது கல்மனதையும் கரைத்து மனிதநேயத்தை மலரச் செய்யும் என்பதே இத்தலைப்பின் குறியீட்டுப் பொருளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the profound symbolic and thematic significance of the short story title 'Oruvan Irukkiran'?"}], "options": {"A": "Even if the entire world rejects an orphan, there exists a soul providing unconditional love; that love possesses the power to awaken dormant humanity in others", "B": "It signifies that a doctor is perpetually on duty at government hospitals to offer medical relief", "C": "It denotes that there will always be a replacement laborer in the cycle repair workshop in Kanchipuram", "D": "It highlights that a fellow tenant will assist when searching for rental houses in Chennai"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 126: Even the most destitute person has someone whose selfless love redeems them; and that very embodiment of empathy awakens moral consciousness in society at large."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 126, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "grammar", "thematic-analysis", "symbolism", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q806", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "literary-emotion-rasa", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"உன்னைப் பார்த்தால்தான் நான் தின்னும் சோறு, சோறாக இருக்கும்\" - வீரப்பனின் இக்கடித வரிகளில் வெளிப்படும் தலையாய உணர்வு / மெய்ப்பாடு யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "பசி மற்றும் உணவு மீதான தணியாத வேட்கை", "B": "தன்னலமற்ற தூய நட்பு மற்றும் உளப்பூர்வமான அன்பு", "C": "அச்சம் மற்றும் இயலாமையின் கழிவிரக்கம்", "D": "தற்பெருமையும் செருக்கும் கலந்த வீரம்"}, "explanation": "வீரப்பன் தனது உயிர் நண்பன் குப்புசாமியின் நலம் மீது கொண்டுள்ள எல்லையற்ற தூய நட்பையும், அவனைக் காணாமல் தான் உண்ணும் உணவும் இனிமை தராது என்ற உண்மைப் பாசத்தையும் இவ்வரிகள் வெளிப்படுத்துகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Only after seeing you will the rice I eat feel like food\" - Which supreme emotion / aesthetic sentiment (Meippadu) radiates from this sentence in Veerappan's letter?"}], "options": {"A": "Inappeasable hunger and craving for nourishment", "B": "Selfless, sublime friendship and heartfelt brotherly love", "C": "Fear and despair arising from helpless destitution", "D": "Vainglory, pride, and haughty valor"}, "explanation": "Veerappan's moving words encapsulate pure, unalloyed friendship and brotherhood, indicating that life loses its zest without his friend's well-being."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 125, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "grammar", "literary-sentiment", "veerappan", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q807", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "narrative-sentence-case-markers", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பத்துப் பதினைந்து நாட்களுக்கு முன்னால் நான் ஆபீசிலிருந்து திரும்பி வீட்டுக்கு வந்தபோது அவன் வாசல் திண்ணையில் உட்கார்ந்துகொண்டிருந்தான்\" - இத்தொடரில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள வேற்றுமை உருபுகளைச் சரியாகக் குறிப்பிடுக:"}], "options": {"A": "ஐ, ஆல் ஆகிய இரண்டாம் மற்றும் மூன்றாம் வேற்றுமை உருபுகள் மட்டும்", "B": "இன், அது ஆகிய ஐந்தாம் மற்றும் ஆறாம் வேற்றுமை உருபுகள் மட்டும்", "C": "கு (நாட்களுக்கு, வீட்டுக்கு), இருந்து (ஆபீசிலிருந்து) ஆகிய நான்காம் மற்றும் ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமை உருபுகள்", "D": "கண், இல் ஆகிய ஏழாம் வேற்றுமை உருபுகள் மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "'நாட்களுக்கு', 'வீட்டுக்கு' என்பனவற்றில் 'கு' நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபாகவும், 'ஆபீசிலிருந்து' என்பதில் 'இருந்து' ஐந்தாம் வேற்றுமைச் சொல்லுருபாகவும் வெளிப்பட்டு வந்துள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the overt case markers/postpositions in: 'Pathu pathinainthu naatkalukku munnaal naan officilirunthu thirumbi veettukku vanthapothu...':"}], "options": {"A": "Only 2nd (ai) and 3rd (aal) case markers", "B": "Only 5th (in) and 6th (athu) case markers", "C": "4th case marker 'ku' (naatkalukku, veettukku) and 5th case postposition 'irunthu' (officilirunthu)", "D": "Only 7th case markers (kan, il)"}, "explanation": "'Naatkalukku' and 'veettukku' bear the 4th case suffix 'ku', while 'officilirunthu' utilizes the 5th case postposition 'irunthu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 122, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "grammar", "case-markers", "linguistics", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q808", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "alagirisamy-works-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கு. அழகிரிசாமி எழுதிய படைப்புகளுள் பொருந்தாத நூலைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "புது வீடு புது உலகம்", "B": "மூன்று பிள்ளைகள்", "C": "கவிச்சக்கரவர்த்தி", "D": "தண்ணீர் தேசம்"}, "explanation": "புது வீடு புது உலகம், மூன்று பிள்ளைகள், கவிச்சக்கரவர்த்தி ஆகியவை கு. அழகிரிசாமியின் படைப்புகள்; 'தண்ணீர் தேசம்' என்பது கவிஞர் வைரமுத்து எழுதிய நாவலாகும். எனவே பொருந்தாதது தண்ணீர் தேசம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the book that does NOT belong to author Ku. Alagirisamy:"}], "options": {"A": "Puthu Veedu Puthu Ulagam", "B": "Moondru Pillaigal", "C": "Kavichakravarthi", "D": "Thanneer Dhesam"}, "explanation": "'Thanneer Dhesam' was authored by poet Vairamuthu, while the other three books are celebrated creations of Ku. Alagirisamy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 126, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "odd_one_out", "alagirisamy", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q809", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "intro-quote-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்' சிறுகதையின் தொடக்கத்தில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள மேற்கோளை நிறைவு செய்க:\n\"எப்படிப்பட்டவருக்கும் ஒரு துணை இருக்கும். அந்தத் துணைதான் மனிதத்தின் வேருக்கு நீர். அதில் ______ துளிர்க்கும்.\""}], "options": {"A": "மனிதம்", "B": "செல்வம்", "C": "வீரம்", "D": "கல்வி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 122 நுழைவுமுன்: \"எப்படிப்பட்டவருக்கும் ஒரு துணை இருக்கும். அந்தத் துணைதான் மனிதத்தின் வேருக்கு நீர். அதில் மனிதம் துளிர்க்கும்\". கோடிட்ட இடத்தில் வர வேண்டிய சொல் 'மனிதம்'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the philosophical quote at the beginning of 'Oruvan Irukkiran':\n\"Everyone will have a companion. That companion is the water to the roots of humankind. In it, ______ will sprout.\""}], "options": {"A": "Manitham (Humanity)", "B": "Selvam (Wealth)", "C": "Veeram (Courage)", "D": "Kalvi (Education)"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 122 Introduction: '...Anthath thunaithaan manithathin vaerukku neer. Athil manitham thulirkkum'. The missing word is 'Manitham' (Humanity)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 122, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["8th-tamil", "iyal-6", "odd_one_out", "quote-completion", "tnpsc"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "8th-u6-q810", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "characters-hometown-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்' சிறுகதையின் பாத்திரங்களுள் காஞ்சிபுரத்தை வாழ்விடமாகக் கொண்டிராத பாத்திரம் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "குப்புசாமி", "B": "தங்கவேலு", "C": "க. வீரப்பன்", "D": "கட்டைத் தொட்டி ஆறுமுகம்"}, "explanation": "குப்புசாமி, வீரப்பன், ஆறுமுகம் ஆகிய மூவரும் காஞ்சிபுரத்தைச் சேர்ந்தவர்கள். தங்கவேலு சென்னையில் குடித்தனம் செய்து வருபவர்; காஞ்சிபுரத்தைச் சேர்ந்தவர் அல்லர். எனவே பொருந்தாதவர் தங்கவேலு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Among the characters in 'Oruvan Irukkiran', who does NOT hail from Kanchipuram?"}], "options": {"A": "Kuppusamy", "B": "Thangavelu", "C": "K. Veerappan", "D": "Kattai Thotti Arumugam"}, "explanation": "Kuppusamy, Veerappan, and Arumugam are residents of Kanchipuram. Thangavelu is an urban resident living in Chennai. Hence Thangavelu is the odd one."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition"