{"id": "8th-u6-q828", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "subject-negative-verb-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுவாய்களுக்குரிய எதிர்மறை வினைமுற்றுகளைப் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) தன்மை ஒருமை (நான்) - 1. அல்லோம்\nஆ) தன்மை பன்மை (நாம்) - 2. அஃது அன்று\nஇ) முன்னிலை ஒருமை (நீ) - 3. அல்லேன்\nஈ) ஒன்றன்பால் (அது) - 4. அல்லை"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-3", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "நான் அல்லேன் (3), நாம் அல்லோம் (1), நீ அல்லை (4), அஃது அன்று (2). சரியான பொருத்தம்: 3, 1, 4, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the grammatical subjects with their corresponding negative verbs:\na) First person singular (Naan) - 1. Allom\nb) First person plural (Naam) - 2. Aqthu andru\nc) Second person singular (Nee) - 3. Allaen\nd) Neuter singular (Athu) - 4. Allai"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "C": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3", "D": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "Naan allaen (3), Naam allom (1), Nee allai (4), Athu andru (2). Correct sequence: 3, 1, 4, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "bo