{"id": "8th-u6-q829", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "third-person-negatives-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "படர்க்கை எழுவாய்களுக்குரிய எதிர்மறை வினைமுற்றுகளைப் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) அவன் - 1. அல்லன்\nஆ) அவள் - 2. அல்லள்\nஇ) அவர் - 3. அல்லர்\nஈ) அவை - 4. அல்ல"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "அவன் அல்லன் (1), அவள் அல்லள் (2), அவர் அல்லர் (3), அவை அல்ல (4). சரியான வரிசை: 1, 2, 3, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the third-person pronouns with their corresponding negative verb endings:\na) Avan (He) - 1. Allan\nb) Aval (She) - 2. Allal\nc) Avar (They - Epicene) - 3. Allar\nd) Avai (They - Neuter) - 4. Alla"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Avan allan (1), Aval allal (2), Avar allar (3), Avai alla (4). Direct sequence: 1, 2, 3, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpo