{"id": "8th-u6-q830", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "lexicon-terms-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களுக்கு நேரான தமிழ்ச் சொற்களைப் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) Hero - 1. வரி\nஆ) Chief Minister - 2. கதாநாயகன்\nஇ) Tax - 3. முதலமைச்சர்\nஈ) Victory - 4. வெற்றி"}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "Hero: கதாநாயகன் (2), Chief Minister: முதலமைச்சர் (3), Tax: வரி (1), Victory: வெற்றி (4). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 3, 1, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the technical English terms with their exact Tamil equivalents:\na) Hero - 1. Vari\nb) Chief Minister - 2. Kathanayagan\nc) Tax - 3. Muthalamaichar\nd) Victory - 4. Vetri"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-1, d-4", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Hero: Kathanayagan (2), Chief Minister: Muthalamaichar (3), Tax: Vari (1), Victory: Vetri (4). Matching order: 2, 3, 1, 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Tex