{"id": "8th-u6-q838", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "8th-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "glossary-incorrect-pair-odd-one", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதிக் கலைச்சொல் இணைகளுள் தவறான ஒன்றைத் தேர்க:"}], "options": {"A": "Chief Minister - முதலமைச்சர்", "B": "Member of Legislative Assembly - நாடாளுமன்ற உறுப்பினர்", "C": "Leadership - தலைமைப் பண்பு", "D": "Victory - வெற்றி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 130: Member of Legislative Assembly (MLA) என்பதன் தமிழாக்கம் 'சட்டமன்ற உறுப்பினர்' ஆகும். 'நாடாளுமன்ற உறுப்பினர்' என்பது Member of Parliament (MP) ஆகும். எனவே இணை B தவறானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the INCORRECT technical terminology pair from the lesson glossary:"}], "options": {"A": "Chief Minister - Muthalamaichar", "B": "Member of Legislative Assembly - Naadaalumanra Uruppinar", "C": "Leadership - Thalaimai Panbu", "D": "Victory - Vetri"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 130: MLA translates to 'Sattamanra Uruppinar'. 'Naadaalumanra Uruppinar' stands for Member of Parliament (MP). Hence pair B is incorrect."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher